// Cyrus charges on the SHARED Nxeon Stripe account (owner decision 2026-10-15: same Stripe account, same company, separate
// products). Everything Cyrus creates carries `product=cyrus` so revenue, refunds, disputes and tax can be reported
// separately (Stripe Sigma / Dashboard filters on metadata), and, where Stripe allows it, the card statement shows CYRUS.
// PURE (no Stripe import). docs/cyrus/10-decisions.md D-70, docs/cyrus/LIVE-PAYMENT-TEST.md.
